  "details": "I think it’d be so cool if you could log on and join the same home instance as a friend. The way I envision this working is that you invite someone to join your home instances, automatically setting your home world as theirs when they accept, and makes it so that if you log on at the same time or if someone’s home, you can log on and automatically be in the same instance.\n\nIt’s like LITERALLY having a home world. I think that’d be cool :)",
